// The ore block itself, in the hand.
//
// Every block needs an item of the *same name* to drop anything at all --
// the placeholder drop policy (PHASE2_ARCHITECTURE.md §4.1), replaced by
// real `drops:` tables in block 2.4. Until then, breaking iron ore yields
// the ore block, not `cubara:raw_iron`: `drops:` is what turns an ore into
// a different item, and Material does not carry it yet.
ItemDef(
    name:       "cubara:iron_ore",
    max_stack:  64,
    durability: None,
)
